I don't think users would do odd things like below, but it would be nice to fix:
import torch
import typing
from typing import List

Tuple = {torch.Tensor : List[torch.Tensor]}
print(Tuple[torch.Tensor])

def f(x: Tuple[torch.Tensor]):
    return x

@torch.jit.script
def g(x: Tuple[torch.Tensor]):
    return x

print(typing.get_type_hints(f))
print(g.graph)
prints
typing.List[torch.Tensor]
{'x': typing.List[torch.Tensor]}
graph(%x : (Tensor)) {
  return (%x);
}

but it should be
typing.List[torch.Tensor]
{'x': typing.List[torch.Tensor]}
graph(%x : Tensor[]) {
  return (%x);
}
